The '''Remnant of the Eye''' is an {{Epic}} item. It prevents death within {{Zone|The End}}.

== Obtaining ==
When an [[Ender Dragon]] spawns, all [[Sleeping Eye]]s within all players' inventories will be converted into '''Remnants of the Eye'''.

'''Remnants of the Eye''' can also be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Pearl Dealer}} for {{c|200,000}}.

== Usage ==
If the player would die in {{Zone|The End}} while carrying a '''Remnant of the Eye''' in their inventory, they are instead healed to full health and granted a short period of invincibility, and the item is consumed. If the death would have been caused by the Void, the player is instead returned to spawn without losing any coins.

It does not work within the {{Zone|Void Sepulture}}. If the player dies there while carrying Remnants of the Eye, they die normally, but their Remnants of the Eye are not consumed.

